      "writtenOn": "2020-03-03T12:49:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Done. The order in line 5962 is actually the correct order in which routes are added. This is because ConnectivityService#updateRoutes first adds all directly-connected routes and then all gatewayed routes. It has to do that because if it tries to add a gatewayed route and there is no route to reach the gateway the operation fails with ENETUNREACH.",
